---

<section id="biomes" class="features-section">
  <div class="section-container">
    <h2 class="section-title">EXPLORE 7 <span class="gradient-text">TIME EPOCHS</span></h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Experience dynamic environment transitions as you survive longer in your run!</p>

    <div class="biomes-grid">
      <div class="biome-card jurassic">
        <div class="biome-icon">🌴</div>
        <h3>Jurassic Epoch</h3>
        <p>Lush prehistoric jungles filled with leaping pterodactyls, rolling boulders, and ancient palm trees.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="biome-card volcano">
        <div class="biome-icon">🌋</div>
        <h3>Volcanic Wasteland</h3>
        <p>Survive active lava pits with music equalizer spout eruptions and falling fiery meteorites.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="biome-card ice">
        <div class="biome-icon">❄️</div>
        <h3>Ice Age Glaciers</h3>
        <p>Cross frozen glaciers under glowing Northern Lights (Aurora Borealis) and swirling snowstorms.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="biome-card desert">
        <div class="biome-icon">🏜️</div>
        <h3>Sandstone Desert</h3>
        <p>Run past ancient 3D Egyptian Pyramids under golden sunbeams and rolling tumbleweeds.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="biome-card forest">
        <div class="biome-icon">🌲</div>
        <h3>Enchanted Forest</h3>
        <p>Misty woods filled with glowing pollen spores, giant mushrooms, and mossy crags.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="biome-card cyberpunk">
        <div class="biome-icon">🏙️</div>
        <h3>Cyberpunk Metropolis</h3>
        <p>Futuristic neon skyline with holographic billboards, digital glitch surges, and synthwave vibes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="biome-card space">
        <div class="biome-icon">🚀</div>
        <h3>Cosmos Zero-G</h3>
        <p>Pick up Gravity Powerups to blast into deep space! Dodge falling meteor showers and catch coin rain.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-card);
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 36px;
    font-weight: 900;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 50px;
  }

  .biomes-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .biome-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: 28px;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, border-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .biome-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    border-color: var(--accent-cyan);
  }

  .biome-icon {
    font-size: 36px;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .biome-card h3 {
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 700;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    color: var(--text-main);
  }

  .biome-card p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
</style>
